  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.94,
      134.71,
      521.22,
      152.85
    ],
    "text": "Mathupala 1992 (1) SLR 329. There are 3 points to be considered as",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.98,
      167.1,
      246.02,
      185.24
    ],
    "text": "reported in the said case viz.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      101.86,
      199.7,
      521.27,
      215.17
    ],
    "text": "(a) where hardship of the landlord is equally balanced with that of the tenant. Land",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.18452262878418
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      120.61,
      220.33,
      243.64,
      235.81
    ],
    "text": "lord's claim must prevail",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      101.85,
      240.98,
      521.33,
      256.46
    ],
    "text": "(b) where hardship of landlord out weighs the hardship to the tenant the landlords",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.18452262878418
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      120.62,
      261.87,
      219.88,
      277.34
    ],
    "text": "claims must prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      102.11,
      282.75,
      521.3,
      298.22
    ],
    "text": "(c) Hardship of the tenant outweighs hardship to the landlord. The landlord's case",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.18452262878418
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      120.46,
      303.63,
      213.76,
      319.1
    ],
    "text": "must be dismissed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      119.65,
      356.48,
      497.02,
      374.62
    ],
    "text": "If one consider the evidence of the Plaintiff-Appellant it cannot be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.161460876464844,
      14.310396194458008
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      84.05,
      388.63,
      522.04,
      406.77
    ],
    "text": "said that hardship of both parties are equally balanced. In fact the landlord's",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.294468879699707
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      421.04,
      521.11,
      439.18
    ],
    "text": "claim does not appear to be so genuine since he was canvassing mainly for",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.84,
      453.43,
      521.71,
      471.58
    ],
    "text": "enhanced rental nor has the original court support the position of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.294468879699707
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      84.12,
      485.82,
      521.45,
      503.97
    ],
    "text": "landlord as far as hardship caused to him. Evidence seems to be more",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.86,
      518.22,
      521.94,
      536.37
    ],
    "text": "artificial merely to rely on the ground of reasonable requirement. Such a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.161460876464844
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.5,
      550.62,
      521.02,
      568.77
    ],
    "text": "requirement does not exist and as such one cannot infer hardship to landlord.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.72,
      583.02,
      521.13,
      601.16
    ],
    "text": "As such the above case has no applicability to the case in hand. The trial",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.44,
      615.18,
      521.78,
      633.33
    ],
    "text": "Judge has carefully considered all basic primary facts, and this court is not",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.86,
      647.35,
      505.02,
      665.49
    ],
    "text": "inclined to disturb those findings in the manner urged by the Appellant. In",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.578283309936523,
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
